							</td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="left"><span class="NewsTitle" id="NewsTitle">The Great Assling Race</span>
							</td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="left"><span class="NewsAuthor" id="NewsAuthor">By
									Reny
								</span>
							</td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td colspan="2" height="10"></td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="center">Holy Halflings!
<p>
CoV members got some funny looks in Rivervale on Thursday the 26th. Why? Everyone was a halfling! Not just ordinary halflings though... everyone who
attended Thursday night's "raid" was a PVP level 1 druid halfling. The bojective was to run across Norrath and die. The path of the race was:
Rivervale too...
Misty Thicket book too...
PoK ( get secret item from Biddio ) too...
Greater Faydark (Felwithe) too
Gfay/Butcher Block zoneline (get secret Item from Tevixa) too...
Kaladim book (get secret item from Biddio) too....
PoK too...
Tox Forrest too...
Paineel newbie area (Grab secret Item off Wyeen)
Jump into the Hole!!! (Die Die Die)
Things started a bit later than planned. The race was supposed to start at 8 PM EST. We didn't actually get started till about 8:30. Everyone gathered and 
turned in their books to become PVP. A few people had to make new toons. Yeah, killing rodents at level 1 is awesome exp. More awesome than some people
thought it would be. Everything went smoothly for most, some got lost in Butcher Block. Guess it has been a while sense we have traveled through that zone. 
There where a few deaths along the way, mostly people forgetting they do get agro in newbie zones.
The winners for the night where:
Chuwy in first place winning; 1kpp and a ton of booze to share.
Samadcit in second place winning; 500pp, a dueling weapon and an AC buff.
Fen in third place winning; 250pp, a dueling weapon and an AC buff.
Fen won the duel between him and Sam. 
Way to go winners! Can't wait till the next run across Norrath... maybe next time everyone will be gnomes! ;)
<p>
<a href='http://circleofvalor.net/screenshots/RV6.jpg
'><img src='http://circleofvalor.net/screenshots/RV6.jpg' border=0 width=800
></a>
</td>
