						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="center"><p align=left>Its been a while since our last update. April showers brought May flowers and a few bosses for our taking. We did Dain x2, Itraer Vius, a couple runs on Agnaar, Ring of yawn err slime, Burrower Parasite x2, Yelinak, Lord Seru, Vindi x2, Statue x2, AoW, Sleepers Tomb warders and Final Arbitor.  Last but not not least 5 hours clearing for Tunare only to have Xegony crash on us minutes from engaging. 


<p align=left>Picked up a couple trinkets along the way.  Congrats goes out to Czai on her Blade of Carnage, Arel on his Barbarian Mask, yours truely on a Bloodied Beserker Blade, Angele and Tumeldarn on their Bile Drenched Flesh Robes, Euramon now wears a Brilliant Stone Ring, Ivey on his Ancient Burrower Hide Tunic.
<p>
<a href='/Screenshots/Burrower-5-9.JPG'><img src='/Screenshots/Burrower-5-9.JPG' width=800 border=0></a>

